{
    "title": "Infinity 8 Ball\u2122 Pool King",
    "description": "Latest Updates:\r\nNew Season! Many new gifts are waiting for you! Come and upgrade your pool cues and pool table! Come and be a pool king!\r\nFirefly Challenge: Beat against the pool masters to catch fireflies, climb the world leaderboard, unlock rare treasure king chests, and catch exclusive rewards for king.\r\n\r\nInfinity 8 Ball\u2122 Pool King has undergone a complete upgrade!\r\nEasier shots! Cooler tables! Richer game modes! Amazing rewards! More pool masters! Whether it's 8 ball, 9 ball, or snooker, if you're a pool master, join and play! To be the king of pool!\r\n\r\nHere, you can enjoy:\r\n\r\nA fantastic gaming experience!\r\nNo more struggling to rotate your phone for aiming! Beat and clear the table more easier online! The angles in Infinity 8 Ball\u2122 Pool King are easier to adjust, the balls are easier to shoot, the chance is easier to catch, and power control is more precise. Guiding lines help you make various spectacular shots, including one-shot multiple balls, long shots, bank shots, carom shots, etc. If you love snooker, you can find snooker games and be a snooker king here too. Come and play balls! Be a ball king!\r\n\r\nScreen recording!\r\nWhen you become the king of 8 ball, when you pocket balls at incredible angles, when you defeat formidable 8 ball masters, wouldn't you want to share or show your spectacular videos with friends? Many 8 ball lovers and snooker lovers would surely give thumbs up for your impressive performance! Play balls! Come and show your love of pool and snooker till infinity!\r\n\r\nReal and fair matches!\r\nA fair matchmaking system pits you against equally skilled opponents! Of course, you can also beat against pool masters! Improve your own pool and snooker skills online! Shoot balls to defeat them all! Compete for the top spot on the online world leaderboard to get joy! At the same time, you can experience the thrill of the pool that rivals the real thing, with aspects like strength, direction, collisions, and spin adding to the fun!\r\n\r\nPlay with friends!\r\nInvite good friends and family to join the game and you'll get rewards! Beat against each other to see who's the ultimate pool master among friends or family! Host an online family party! The game also provides ample and easier opportunities for making friends and getting your joy in the social aspect online! Play balls with friends!\r\n\r\nVarious equipment!\r\nInfinity 8 Ball\u2122 Pool King offers an infinite variety of rewards including equipment and attire! You'll find a table or cue or balls which would catch your love definitely! Challenge yourself to unlock and upgrade your unique cue and balls, achieving unprecedented satisfaction! The more masters you beat against, the more joy you will get! Make your shots even more enjoyable!\r\n\r\nDiverse and colorful challenge modes!\r\nEndless challenge 8 ball modes keep you from ever getting bored! Unique tables, different balls, special scoring rules, one-shot challenges, timed events... a variety of activities and rewards to easily bring you joy!\r\n\r\nTimely feedback and updates!\r\nIf you have any ideas or suggestions, feel free to tell us in the Help & Support section of the game. We will promptly consider your thoughts on creating a better 8 ball game joy for you!\r\n\r\nPlay and you will love Infinity 8 Ball\u2122 Pool King till time of infinity!\r\n\r\nFollow us here:\r\nFacebook page: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100075883630039\r\nInstagram page: https://www.instagram.com/infinity8ballpoolking_official",
    "descriptionHTML": "Latest Updates:<br>New Season! Many new gifts are waiting for you! Come and upgrade your pool cues and pool table! Come and be a pool king!<br>Firefly Challenge: Beat against the pool masters to catch fireflies, climb the world leaderboard, unlock rare treasure king chests, and catch exclusive rewards for king.<br><br>Infinity 8 Ball\u2122 Pool King has undergone a complete upgrade!<br>Easier shots! Cooler tables! Richer game modes! Amazing rewards! More pool masters! Whether it&#39;s 8 ball, 9 ball, or snooker, if you&#39;re a pool master, join and play! To be the king of pool!<br><br>Here, you can enjoy:<br><br>A fantastic gaming experience!<br>No more struggling to rotate your phone for aiming! Beat and clear the table more easier online! The angles in Infinity 8 Ball\u2122 Pool King are easier to adjust, the balls are easier to shoot, the chance is easier to catch, and power control is more precise. Guiding lines help you make various spectacular shots, including one-shot multiple balls, long shots, bank shots, carom shots, etc. If you love snooker, you can find snooker games and be a snooker king here too. Come and play balls! Be a ball king!<br><br>Screen recording!<br>When you become the king of 8 ball, when you pocket balls at incredible angles, when you defeat formidable 8 ball masters, wouldn&#39;t you want to share or show your spectacular videos with friends? Many 8 ball lovers and snooker lovers would surely give thumbs up for your impressive performance! Play balls! Come and show your love of pool and snooker till infinity!<br><br>Real and fair matches!<br>A fair matchmaking system pits you against equally skilled opponents! Of course, you can also beat against pool masters! Improve your own pool and snooker skills online! Shoot balls to defeat them all! Compete for the top spot on the online world leaderboard to get joy! At the same time, you can experience the thrill of the pool that rivals the real thing, with aspects like strength, direction, collisions, and spin adding to the fun!<br><br>Play with friends!<br>Invite good friends and family to join the game and you&#39;ll get rewards! Beat against each other to see who&#39;s the ultimate pool master among friends or family! Host an online family party! The game also provides ample and easier opportunities for making friends and getting your joy in the social aspect online! Play balls with friends!<br><br>Various equipment!<br>Infinity 8 Ball\u2122 Pool King offers an infinite variety of rewards including equipment and attire! You&#39;ll find a table or cue or balls which would catch your love definitely! Challenge yourself to unlock and upgrade your unique cue and balls, achieving unprecedented satisfaction! The more masters you beat against, the more joy you will get! Make your shots even more enjoyable!<br><br>Diverse and colorful challenge modes!<br>Endless challenge 8 ball modes keep you from ever getting bored! Unique tables, different balls, special scoring rules, one-shot challenges, timed events... a variety of activities and rewards to easily bring you joy!<br><br>Timely feedback and updates!<br>If you have any ideas or suggestions, feel free to tell us in the Help &amp; Support section of the game. We will promptly consider your thoughts on creating a better 8 ball game joy for you!<br><br>Play and you will love Infinity 8 Ball\u2122 Pool King till time of infinity!<br><br>Follow us here:<br>Facebook page: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100075883630039<br>Instagram page: https://www.instagram.com/infinity8ballpoolking_official",
